      "labels": [],
      "body": "Section 1 states:\n   In this document, we define a new type of VDS, associated with an\n   application of the Confidential Consortium Framework (CCF) ledger\n   that implements the SCITT Architecture defined in\n   [I-D.ietf-scitt-architecture]. \n\n\nSection 2 states: \n\n   This document defines inclusion proofs for CCF ledgers.\n\nShould we also state in the introduction that, this document defines a new type of VDS.....and the inclusion proofs?",
      "createdAt": "2026-04-01T17:19:48Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-04-01T23:03:36Z",
      "closedAt": "2026-04-01T23:03:36Z",
